WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.350
<b>Episode Seven
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.310
Delicious!

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.810
I'm so hungry right now!

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.060
Didn't expect this of you, Ah Jie.

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.480
It's amazing what you can do

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.940
with just instant ramen and junk food.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.060
I had no choice.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.480
I've been on my own since I was a kid.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.190
If I didn't learn how to cook, I'd starve.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:09.480
If you don't mind,

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.190
could you tell us more about your past?

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:14.700
Honestly, there isn't much to tell.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.130
I lived with my parents until I was five.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.730
But we were always moving.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.850
I transferred from school to school 
as we moved from city to city.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.230
So I never made any friends.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.020
Then, one day,

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.850
my old man disappeared 
without a word.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.350
A few months after that,

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:34.600
my mom did, too.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.560
I've had distant relatives 
taking care of me since then,

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.960
and I lived a pretty normal life until now.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.060
That's all in the past now.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.280
Don't be so sad.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.890
Right, Dora.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.980
I don't think you've told us anything 
about you ever since we met.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.480
Maybe it's old age,

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.640
but even though I've lived 
for three million years,

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.050
there isn't much that I remember.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:03.900
I can vaguely remember that...

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.600
in the beginning, I was all alone.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:12.460
I met lots of people, 
and lots of things happened.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.980
But I was always wandering 
from place to place.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.400
What I can remember...

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.490
is hazy.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:21.480
Like my memories are in pieces.

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:24.490
If I try too hard to recall them,

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:27.390
my head starts to hurt.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.770
You should take it easy.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.180
You passed out last time.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.270
No way.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.350
Amnesia again?

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:36.310
Sounds like some K-drama.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.480
She's telling the truth.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.310
I can vouch for her.

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:43.320
Just a little earlier, I sneakily 
did a full-body scan of Dora.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.390
Pay attention to where her heart is.

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.890
There's something strange there.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.190
She didn't lose her memories.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.020
They were sealed away.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.560
What?

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.250
How do we lift this seal, then?

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.350
That, I have no idea.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:01.270
Maybe take the typical K-drama approach?

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:02.310
Blunt force trauma,

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:03.560
a strong surge of emotion,

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.810
or finding the person who sealed them away...

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.110
Could be any of those.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.810
I'm such a poor girl.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.600
My heart was locked away.

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:23.270
Stop acting so kittenish!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:25.450
I can't control myself!

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:30.570
Now that we've eaten, 
we should get some sleep.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:35.440
After all, we have a life-and-death 
battle awaiting us tomorrow.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.060
<i>Approaching destination.</i>

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.690
<i>The target is 1.5 kilometers away.</i>

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.320
<i>Terminating self-driving mode.</i>

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.500
I'm still sleepy...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.310
This is as far as we can go by car.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.800
We'll need to walk the rest of the way.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.850
Is this the Stone Forest?

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.600
It's kinda gloomy here.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.890
I got a bad feeling about this.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:17.810
Let's find a way forward.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:19.800
Yeah.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:28.730
I'm a goddess.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.560
Why am I doing all the grunt work?

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.770
According to the satellite map,

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.100
there should be a hidden entrance up ahead.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.600
Huh?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.610
There are signs that people lived here.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.810
Hard to believe, eh?

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:00.810
This used to be a village.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.440
The conditions here may be poor,

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:05.150
but the village flourished decently well.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.310
And yet, one day ten years ago,

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:11.980
the entire village was wiped from the map.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.850
After that,

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:17.100
there have been frequent rumors of 
passersby disappearing without a trace.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.840
What about the people who lived here?

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.880
I hate horror stories!

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:24.530
Look, up ahead!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:46.060
I didn't expect the Stone Forest to be 
hiding a sea of flowers like this.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.390
How peculiar...

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.900
Pretty, though.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.070
Red spider lilies.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.060
We've found the right place.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.560
This can't be the Destroyers' 
secret hideout, can it?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.520
I can only detect a single, weak source 
of fluctuating spiritual power.

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:10.060
It's more likely to be the 
hideout of one of their members.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.480
Get down!

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.100
Miaowu, what's all this about?!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.180
Someone's here.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.190
Facial recognition successful.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.230
Matching via the Internet.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.230
Is that him?

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:08.190
You dummy!

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.390
Until we figure things out, 
don't do anything rash!

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.190
Let's just watch for now.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.190
No spiritual power fluctuation detected.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.190
Any way you look at it,

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:44.020
this man is just a normal farmer.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:47.060
Stan, still nothing on him?

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.600
It's downloading super slowly.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.100
There's, like, no signal 
out here in the sticks.

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:56.600
We're wasting our time!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.100
Lemme just bash his—

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.010
Slow down, you dumbass!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.100
How is it?

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.190
35 percent done.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:41.060
The mountain's magnetic field 
is probably disrupting the signal.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.940
It's hot and humid.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.680
I can smell a thunderstorm coming.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.730
We need to act now.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.460
I'm tired. I'm starving. My legs are sore.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.980
And there are so many mosquitoes!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.810
And rodents! I just saw a big vole!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.520
Oh my god! Help me!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.930
Crap! We're gonna get busted!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.900
Damn, she's useless.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:11.810
How's it look?

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.000
Did he see us?

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.170
Not only did he see us,

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.950
he's waving at us.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.040
Pardon the intrusion, sir.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.940
This is a surprise.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.310
I wasn't expecting company today.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.310
It's been years since anyone's passed by.

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:42.270
We're students at Wind Forest High.

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.210
We're here for some field work.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.600
"We"?

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.650
But you're alone.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.310
He can't see me!

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:54.980
He's probably not a Summoner.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.640
So it was the vole that he spotted, not me.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.520
My classmates are waiting outside.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:06.890
I spotted a house here,

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.650
and I wanted to buy some food.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.230
Is that so?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.620
Well then, welcome.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.140
You must be tired.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:14.520
Have some tea.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:16.940
Thank you.

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:22.980
If you'd like,

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.270
you and your friends can 
have these packed meals.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.730
I have snacks in the house, too.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:29.560
Let me get you some.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.230
No need, no need!

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:31.560
This is more than enough.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:32.850
Is that so?

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.060
This man's quite enthusiastic.

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.940
Do we have the wrong guy?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:43.650
Are you the only one here?

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.690
That's right.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:47.270
It's been a dozen or so years now.

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.940
I've always lived here alone.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.690
Not a lot of visitors pass by.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:55.240
I'm actually pretty excited 
that you stopped by today.

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.690
I haven't seen anyone for a long time,

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.690
so I couldn't help but keep talking.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:00.940
Sorry about that.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:02.850
It's fine.

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:04.280
I'm always happy to chat.

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:07.100
He's kinda cute, in a way.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.240
The wind's blowing.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:19.360
The flowers are beautiful.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.460
Did you plant them yourself?

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.060
Yeah.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.440
When you live in the mountains,

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.350
there's not much you can do.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.900
I can sleep, or I can tend the flowers.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.400
How long did it take you to plant all these?

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:38.060
Well...

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:40.770
It's a long story.

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.190
Many years ago,

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.520
the lands here used to be pretty barren.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.440
The villagers toiled away in the fields,

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:52.550
but all they got for their 
efforts were sour, ugly fruits.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:55.150
There was once an innocent girl.

00:12:55.890 --> 00:13:01.230
She always dreamed of growing flowers 
over this field of rock.

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:03.910
She kept at it for years.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.250
She tried many different kinds of seeds,

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.350
but not one of them lived.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.640
After she passed away,

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.480
I decided to inherit her dying wish.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.440
Perhaps it was heaven, too, 
who wanted to see her wish come true,

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.280
but after that, the flowers started to bloom.

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:23.100
One bloom,

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.230
two blooms,

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:25.480
three blooms.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:26.980
One year,

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:27.890
two years,

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:28.940
three years.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:31.770
It took me ten years

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:34.240
to turn this place into a sea of flowers.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.000
What a touching story...

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:40.840
If my hunch is right,

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:43.770
that girl must have been your first love.

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:47.920
I must've said too much.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.730
He's blushing!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.560
Damn it, Stan.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.270
Are we done yet?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.190
Almost there.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.130
It's at 99 percent. Give me another minute.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:04.640
There's no time.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.190
The storm's almost here!

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:13.870
It's so windy!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.480
Sir?

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.230
Why don't we head inside?

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:23.270
Hey! Sir?

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:27.920
What's wrong with you?

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:31.060
He doesn't look so good.

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:32.710
Flowers.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.560
Flowers.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.770
What was that?!

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:36.680
Flowers.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.460
Flowers.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.200
Flowers.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:47.970
My...

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.730
My...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:53.040
My flowers!

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:55.870
My flowers!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.140
My flowers!

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:00.020
No one may hurt my flowers!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:00.770
There we go.

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:01.600
Download complete!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.650
What's with him?

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:14.270
No time to explain!

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:16.100
Quick! Let's get him!

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:17.770
What?

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.810
Kill him!

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:40.390
Help...

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.650
Help... me...

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.940
It's too late...

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.600
He's coming!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:06.980
That's him!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.650
Des...

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.150
This guy...

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.400
...troy!

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:18.150
Holy Shield!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:22.810
Ah Jie!

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:23.680
Dora!

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.940
Claw Wind Strikes!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:38.640
His skin's so thick!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:39.270
Damn it!

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:44.100
Our turn now!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:48.910
Got him!

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:53.310
Huh?

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:01.480
Damn it!

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.200
Normal weapons are useless against him!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:05.890
Dora!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.610
I've still got a trump card up my sleeve,

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:10.940
but I'll need some time 
to summon it with Ah Jie!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.030
Stan.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:17.740
Cover us for the time being.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:22.730
My turn!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.400
Miaowu! Don't rush in!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.520
Relax.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:37.310
I'm pretty confident in my speed.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:39.850
Miaowu...

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:49.560
Such speed!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.010
Miaowu's got the upper hand!

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:52.940
I'm still worried, though.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:54.990
The stone man might keep on missing her,

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:57.150
but if he lands just one punch...

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.730
Miaowu!

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:14.520
She's seriously injured.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.690
The power imbalance is huge.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.920
Looks like this'll be a fight to the end.

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:24.730
Stan.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.230
Damn it!

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:34.910
There's nothing I can use 
out here in the sticks!

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:38.600
All right.

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:43.880
I'll do everything I can 
to buy you guys three minutes.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.640
If something happens and I die,

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.440
bring all the new anime 
and figures to my grave.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.930
Stan.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:03.190
The stone man,

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:04.770
Destroyer code name: Ruthless.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:05.600
A Summoner of earth.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:16.270
Real name: Moduo. 26 years old.

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:17.770
A native of the Stone Forest.

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:22.350
Scans show severe trauma in his brain.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:24.560
He might have split personalities 
or some kind of mental illness.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.730
Stan used holographic projection 
to form a shadow clone!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:33.770
Keep at it, Dora!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:37.190
The prime suspect in a dozen or 
so large-scale terrorist attacks,

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.180
an internationally wanted criminal,

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:42.540
and a cold-blooded, natural-born killer.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.630
Moduo, your sins will never be forgiven.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.270
Des...

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:57.310
troy!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:02.950
Stan!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:03.690
Holy Shield!

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.810
Skeletons?

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.110
There are so many bodies

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.490
underneath the flowers.

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:29.060
Men and women, old and young.

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:30.760
There's no telling how many.

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:34.980
Looks like...

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:39.320
we found the reason the 
whole village disappeared.

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.930
Are you ready yet, Ah Jie?

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.940
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:55.310
It's over!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:15.120
<i>Ah Jie.</i>

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.800
<i>Can you feel it?</i>

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.000
What a powerful surge of energy...

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.690
<i>I'm sharing my memories with you.</i>

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.390
<i>The characteristics and 
techniques of all the weapons</i>

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.830
<i>are all in your memories now.</i>

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:33.370
<i>Don't think.</i>

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.440
<i>All you need to do... is attack.</i>

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.060
<i>Attack like mad.</i>

00:21:44.390 --> 00:21:45.600
Silver Lance!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:52.600
<i>Amazing!</i>

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:54.520
<i>Don't think.</i>

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.270
<i>Leave it all to your intuition.</i>

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:00.850
Sky-Rending Sword!

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:07.270
Reverse-Blade Draw!

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.480
Quick! Attack his core!

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:11.770
<i>Leave it all to your subconscious.</i>

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:13.190
Spirit Dagger!

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:25.850
Dragon-Slaying Sword!

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:33.270
<i>Leave it all to your battle instincts.</i>

00:22:30.940 --> 00:22:33.270
Thor's Hammer!
